### 1. Get a token with read scope (demo token endpoint stands in for Entra ID)
POST http://localhost:5100/demo/token?user=bab&scopes=orders.read&mfa=false

### 2. Call with the token -> 200
GET http://localhost:5100/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Approve without the Approver role / MFA -> 403
POST http://localhost:5100/api/orders/ORD-1/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
